OL,3,CSouthport killer charged with assaults
OL,4,Con prison staff
OL,6,FThe Southport killer has been charged
OL,7,Fwith four offences while in prison,
OL,8,Fincluding assault on an emergency
OL,9,Fworker and possession of a weapon.
OL,11,FAxel Rudakubana faces multiple charges
OL,12,Frelating to separate incidents at HMP
OL,13,FBelmarsh between May and October 2025,
OL,14,Fthe Metropolitan Police said.
OL,16,FThe 19-year-old has been charged with:
OL,18,FHe will appear before Westminster
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court via videolink on
OL,20,FFriday, 11 September.
