OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785540774
OL,3,CSouthport killer charged with assaults
OL,4,Con prison staff
OL,6,FRudakubana was jailed for a minimum of
OL,7,F52 years for the murders of three
OL,8,Fgirls and attempted murders of eight
OL,9,Fother children, class instructor
OL,10,FLeanne Lucas and businessman John
OL,11,FHayes.
OL,13,FThis week marked two years since he
OL,14,Fcarried out the attack at a Taylor
OL,15,FSwift-themed dance class on 29 July
OL,16,F2024.
OL,18,FThe Ministry of Justice confirmed on
OL,19,FFriday, 24 July, that the killer was
OL,20,Ftransferred from prison to Broadmoor
OL,21,Fpsychiatric hospital.
